      "tier": 1,
      "title": "逐字节拆开 PostgreSQL 的 MVCC",
      "summary": "Radim Marek 用 pageinspect 把 MVCC 拆到字节。元组头里两个 32 位事务号，t_xmin 记插入者、t_xmax 记删除或更新者，为 0 表示仍然活跃；t_infomask 用 HEAP_XMIN_COMMITTED 之类的位缓存提交状态。要点是 UPDATE 只追加新版本，旧版本等 VACUUM 回收；SELECT 首次碰到新数据会设提示位，把页标脏引出 IO。",
      "url": "https://boringsql.com/posts/postgresql-mvcc-byte-by-byte/",
      "author": "Radim Marek",
      "source": "boringsql",
      "source_date": "2026-04-17",
      "image": "https://boringsql.com/og-images/postgresql-mvcc-byte-by-byte-og.jpg",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "MVCC",
        "存储",
        "膨胀"
      ],
      "position": 1
