    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "Ignition 的历史库改用 TimescaleDB",
      "summary": "Tiger Data 的 Doug Pagnutti 讲 Ignition 的 SQL Historian 怎么接 TimescaleDB。Ignition 把标签历史写进 PostgreSQL，而行式存储是为事务设计的，面对窄表、只追加的时序数据并不合适。TimescaleDB 按时间自动切块，旧块转列式压缩，新块保持行式以维持写入速度。接法是关掉 Ignition 内置分区，把历史表转成超表，再加压缩与保留策略。",
      "url": "https://www.tigerdata.com/blog/ignition-and-timescaledb-perfect-pairing",
      "author": "Doug Pagnutti",
      "source": "Tiger Data 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-04-17",
      "image": "https://blog-cms.tigerdata.com/blog/content/images/2026/04/Ignition-Integration-Guide.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "时序",
        "物联网",
        "压缩"
      ],
      "position": 4
